sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as SmartPot-API
  participant G as SmartPot-DataGenerator (Axum :8081)
  participant P as PotManager
  participant D as VirtualDevice
  participant B as SmartPot-Broker (EMQX)
  A->>G: PUT /v1/pots/{cropId} (key, species, mode, location, interval)
  G->>P: Provision or update virtual pot
  P->>D: Connect MQTT client with clientId smartpot-sim-{cropId}
  D->>B: CONNECT with LWT offline status
  D->>B: Publish status online (retained)
  D->>B: Publish capabilities (retained)
  loop Every sampling interval
    P->>P: Step physics environment model & add sensor noise
    D->>B: Publish telemetry (JSON v1 or compact binary v2)
  end
  B->>D: Dispatch command {id, actuator, action, durationSeconds}
  D->>P: Apply actuator effect to environment
  D->>B: Publish commands/ack EXECUTED
  A->>G: GET /v1/pots/{cropId}
